      "numbered_excerpt": "69|Outcomes\n70|The primary outcome was the effi cacy of two successive\n71|administrations of several injections of botulinum\n72|toxin A, compared with placebo, measured as the change\n73|in weekly self-reported mean pain intensity (mean pain\n74|over the past 24 h recorded each morning in a diary)\n75|on the 11-point numerical rating scale (0=no pain,\n76|10=maximum pain imaginable) of the Brief Pain\n77|Inventory from baseline (1 week before randomisation)\n78|over 24 weeks after the fi rst administration.17",
